# Replace @your-org/* with the real teams in your GitHub org.
# Drop this file at .github/CODEOWNERS and turn on branch protection ->
# "Require review from Code Owners".

# Default reviewer
*                                      @your-org/data-platform

# Infrastructure as code
**/*.tf                                @your-org/data-platform-iac
**/*.tfvars                            @your-org/data-platform-iac
**/cdk/                                @your-org/data-platform-iac
**/infra/                              @your-org/data-platform-iac

# Glue / PySpark transformations
**/glue_jobs/                          @your-org/data-eng

# Orchestration (Step Functions ASL, Airflow DAGs)
**/orchestration/                      @your-org/data-eng @your-org/data-platform
**/dags/                               @your-org/data-eng

# Agent components (prompts, tools, evals)
**/prompts/                            @your-org/agent-platform
**/tools/                              @your-org/agent-platform
**/evals/                              @your-org/agent-platform

# Security-sensitive paths
**/iam/                                @your-org/data-platform @your-org/security
**/guardrails/                         @your-org/agent-platform @your-org/security
**/policies/                           @your-org/security

# CI / CD
.github/                               @your-org/data-platform
